stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> pending : lab accepts the item - init_stages
    pending --> at_lab : start - system, next round due
    at_lab --> sent_to_clinic : dispatch - lab ships the round
    sent_to_clinic --> received : receive - clinic receives
    received --> tryin_done : record_tryin
    tryin_done --> approved : approve
    tryin_done --> correction : request_correction
    approved --> [*]
    correction --> [*] : new round_no plus 1 starts at pending
